content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le13ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le13ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le13ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Friends, professors, administrators, and parents, welcome.To the class of 20\u2026we did it. We finally graduated.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le13ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Today marks the end of one chapter and the beginning of a new one in the book of life.<br>\nIt just seems like last year, that we sat nervously in our first class, anticipating difficult classes and challenging professors. All of those nights we crammed for the test the next morning, all of the books we read and the essays we wrote, all of the lessons we learned from not only our professors, but our friends as well. Now, we stand with confidence.  We will use the skills and training we gained to meet life head on.", "id": 2, "time": "11500", "image": "engenn5le13ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "It's remarkable, isn't it? I think I speak for most of us when I say that the past four years went by faster than we ever imagined.  I remember being a freshman and thinking about how long college would take; but the thing is, I remember thinking about that as if it was last week. We will all take different paths; some might move on to MBA degrees,  others may begin internships and paid positions. We all share memories and incredible experiences that will last us a lifetime.<br>\n<br>Best of luck to all of you as we move closer to our future goals.", "id": 3, "time": "48500", "image": "engenn5le13ob08re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le13ob08re2vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "", "image": ""}, {"text": "Friends, professors, administrators, and parents, welcome.</br>To the class of 20 ... we did it. We finally graduated.</br>", "id": 1, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "Today marks the end of one chapter and the beginning of a new one in the book of life.It just seems like last year, that we sat nervously in our first class, anticipating difficult classes and challenging professors. All of those nights we crammed for the test the next morning, all of the books we read and the essays we wrote, all of the lessons we learned from not only our professors, but our friends as well. Now, we stand with confidence.  We will use the skills and training we gained to meet life head on.", "id": 2, "time": "9000", "image": ""}, {"text": "It's remarkable, isn't it? I think I speak for most of us when I say that the past four years went by faster than we ever imagined.  I remember being a freshman and thinking about how long college would take; but the thing is, I remember thinking about that as if it was last week. We will all take different paths; some might move on to MBA degrees,  others may begin internships and paid positions.", "id": 3, "time": "39000", "image": ""}, {"text": "We all share memories and incredible experiences that will last us a lifetime. Best of luck to all of you as we move closer to our future goals.", "id": 4, "time": "63000", "image": ""}]}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": ""}]}, {"id": 4, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le13ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter's Graduation"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Writing A Speech"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 13}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about methods of communication and communication technology in common social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le13ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing A Speech"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">An introduction</span><br><br>  It should get the audience's attention, describe the topic, state the reason for your speech, and give an overview of the speech and its main points.  <br><br> Example (topic sentence):<br><br>  <span class=\"italic\">Today marks the end of one chapter and the beginning of a new one in the book of life.</span> <br><br> <span class=\"strong\">Main Points</span> <br><br> These are the key areas that you cover in your speech. <br><br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: friends, teachers, classes</span> <br><br> <span class=\"strong\">Transitions</span> <br><br> Transitions are the ways you move from one topic to another in a speech. <br><br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: likewise, also, furthermore</span>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Will, May, Might"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might </span>or <span class=\"italic\">could </span> to show possibility.<br> They have the same meaning."}, {"type": "text", "content": "They are placed before a verb in the base form. The verb does not change."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Some might decide to take MBA degrees. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Graduates may decide to start paid work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to deliver "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to present a speech, statement, etc. to a group of people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "  Example: Peter's classmate delivers the valedictorian speech."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use in a speech."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "end of a chapter "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a point in time that ends an event or stage "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Graduation marks the end of a chapter."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cram "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to prepare for a test, exam, etc., by learning a lot of information quickly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: We had to cram for our Accounting test."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "remarkable "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unusual or surprising : likely to be noticed  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's remarkable that three years of school is complete."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "freshman "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to a student in the first year of high school or college "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I am a freshman at college."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to anticipate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to to think of (something that will or might happen in the future)                                                                                                                     "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am anticipating a lot of change next year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think about 2 important things you learned from school."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write two 70-word paragraphs. Each paragraph has 1 main point."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include a topic sentence, supporting sentences and a concluding sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use a transition to join the paragraphs together like <span class=\"italic\">also</span>, <span class=\"italic\">furthermore</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">likewise</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraphs to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Remember to keep your audience's attention."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I think about past experiences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write paragraphs about school and education."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present part of a speech to a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}